<section class="rt-features-section" id="Features">
  <div class="rt-section-header">
    <span class="rt-section-badge">ENGINEERING & CRAFTSMANSHIP</span>
    <h2 class="rt-section-title">Anatomy of a Vintage Icon</h2>
    <p class="rt-section-sub">
      Designed in Tokyo, celebrated worldwide. Every contour, link, and pixel has been refined for 40+ years of uninterrupted prestige.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="rt-features-grid">
    <div class="rt-feature-card">
      <span class="rt-feature-number">01 // CASING</span>
      <div class="rt-feature-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle>
          <polyline points="12 6 12 12 14 14"></polyline>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="rt-feature-title">Ultra-Slim 9.6mm Profile</h3>
      <p class="rt-feature-desc">
        Sculpted with an ultra-thin 9.6mm octagonal silhouette weighing a featherlight 49 grams. Glides seamlessly under tailored shirt cuffs while holding an unmistakable architectural edge with modern streetwear.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-feature-card">
      <span class="rt-feature-number">02 // ILLUMINATION</span>
      <div class="rt-feature-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="rt-feature-title">EL Blue-Green Night Glow</h3>
      <p class="rt-feature-desc">
        Casio’s signature ElectroLuminescent panel saturates the entire LCD in a vibrant, uniform cyan glow at the tap of a button. Delivers instant, high-contrast legibility in pitch-black darkness with zero hot spots.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-feature-card">
      <span class="rt-feature-number">03 // BRACELET</span>
      <div class="rt-feature-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <rect x="2" y="7" width="20" height="10" rx="2"></rect>
          <line x1="7" y1="7" x2="7" y2="17"></line>
          <line x1="17" y1="7" x2="17" y2="17"></line>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="rt-feature-title">Brushed Stainless Steel</h3>
      <p class="rt-feature-desc">
        Multi-link stainless steel bracelet finished in satin-brushed luster with a tool-free sliding lock clasp. Delivers a featherlight, snag-free fit calibrated to any wrist size in five seconds with zero pin tools needed.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-feature-card">
      <span class="rt-feature-number">04 // MODULE</span>
      <div class="rt-feature-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <circle cx="12" cy="14" r="8"></circle>
          <line x1="12" y1="2" x2="12" y2="6"></line>
          <line x1="12" y1="10" x2="12" y2="14"></line>
          <line x1="12" y1="14" x2="15" y2="14"></line>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="rt-feature-title">1/100-Sec Stopwatch & Alarm</h3>
      <p class="rt-feature-desc">
        Driven by Casio’s battle-tested 593 digital quartz module tuned to ±30 seconds a month. Features 1/100th-second precision split timing, acoustic daily alarms, hourly time signals, and an auto-calendar that never misses a beat.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-feature-card">
      <span class="rt-feature-number">05 // RESILIENCE</span>
      <div class="rt-feature-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <path d="M12 2.69l5.66 5.66a8 8 0 1 1-11.31 0z"></path>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="rt-feature-title">30-Meter Water Resistance</h3>
      <p class="rt-feature-desc">
        Precision rubber-gasket sealed against heavy monsoon downpours, gym sweat, accidental drenching, and everyday hand washing. Engineered for real life with zero babying required.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="rt-feature-card">
      <span class="rt-feature-number">06 // ENDURANCE</span>
      <div class="rt-feature-icon">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2">
          <rect x="2" y="7" width="16" height="10" rx="2" ry="2"></rect>
          <line x1="22" y1="11" x2="22" y2="13"></line>
        </svg>
      </div>
      <h3 class="rt-feature-title">7-Year Long-Life Battery</h3>
      <p class="rt-feature-desc">
        Powered by an ultra-low-drain Japanese microcircuit sipping from a single CR2016 lithium cell. Zero charging cables, zero daily battery anxiety—just seven full years of continuous, dependable timekeeping.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

